NOTE ON MEDIA ASSETS

The video and poster assets (assets/earth/*, assets/moss/*) are NOT part of this
repository and are NOT covered by the MIT grant above. Per the upstream project's
own manifest, those clips originate from a Wallpaper Engine project and are
licensed for the upstream author's local use only, without redistribution.
Run scripts/fetch-assets.ps1 to obtain them from the upstream repository on your
own machine.
